research/audit/wave8-real-analysis-absolute-convergence.provenance.jsonl-8-{"id":"thm-dirichlet-rearrangement","statement":"literature-derived","proof":"ai-altered","evidence":"exact-source","urls":["https://www.math.uci.edu/~ndonalds/math140a/notes.pdf","https://www.math.ucdavis.edu/~hunter/intro_analysis_pdf/ch4.pdf"],"rationale":"The theorem that every rearrangement of an absolutely convergent real series has the same sum appears exactly in the cited notes; the proof is the standard finite-tail argument.","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-09"}
