research/audit/wave8-preserved-certifiers/page-absolute-convergence-and-rearrangement--efed5a77746176ba.prompt.md-182-[[fs-infinite-product-converges-iff-terms-tend-to-one]] records that factors
research/audit/wave8-preserved-certifiers/page-absolute-convergence-and-rearrangement--efed5a77746176ba.prompt.md-183-tending to $1$ decide nothing. **No logarithm is used anywhere on this page**;
research/audit/wave8-preserved-certifiers/page-absolute-convergence-and-rearrangement--efed5a77746176ba.prompt.md-184-every one of those inequalities is an induction on finite products, and the
