items/thm-complex-exponential-surjects-onto-the-punctured-plane.md:28:The complex exponential maps $\mathbb C$ onto $\mathbb C\setminus\{0\}$. The conventions and prerequisite facts used below are recorded in [[thm-polar-form-with-unique-principal-argument]], [[cor-complex-exponential-cartesian-form-modulus-and-eulers-identity]], [[def-natural-logarithm]], [[thm-natural-logarithm-laws]].
